Z||000001||Old Lar||09-07-2001||04:09 PM||||Need some sort of description of what is happening.<P>1. Could be cruise control stalk<BR>      Broken wire, bad connection<P>2. Could be coffee can vaccuum leak<BR>       Check the rubber vaccuum lines into coffee can.  Rust holes?<P>3. Could be cruise control bellows<P>Check to see if the coffee can is able to hold vaccuum..easiest.||||reg||1
Z||000002||TSPalmer||09-07-2001||04:36 PM||||Don't forget the switches on the brake pedal and if you have a manual gearbox, the switch on the clutch pedal.  Good luck and let us know what you find out.<P>------------------<BR>T.Shawn Palmer<BR>'85 SE 4cyl 5spd||||reg||1
